User Manual

Recruitment Module

www.flowhcm.com

Job Request

Click on Recruitment on the top navigation bar

You can see the Job Request form

To add Job request, click on Apply for Job Request

Select the required data from dropdowns for the Job

Select skill set required and No. of positions

Job can be assigned to any specific employee for screening from Assign to Employee dropdown

Enter required Candidate Salary and Age range

A target joining date of candidate can be selected for the recruiter to be notified

Attachment feature is also available

Enter the required Job Experience, Description and Qualification of candidate

Click on submit button to raise a requisition

Request can be seen in grid along with some Action button features

View Report

To view the data of grid in Job Request form click on view report

Job Request Report will pop up on screen

Job Post

To add a Job Post, click on Add Job Post

Select Job Opening Field Template and Pipeline from dropdowns

User can either use the Job request data that will fill all the fields automatically else apply the same process as in Job Request fill all fields manually

Enter a closing date of applying for the Job Post

There is a feature of Job Portal in Recruitment Module, the Job will be published on the portal and candidate can apply online.
